{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>which Elohim has given me here</b>. Joseph had no need to inform his father that they were born to him in Egypt, for when he parted from him he had no wife or children, and Jacob already said to him, \"your two sons who were born to you in the land of Egypt.\" It appears to me that the meaning of \"here\" is in this matter that you have mentioned — that HaShem gave them to me before your coming to me to Egypt, and they are the ones about whom you said that they are yours. So too, \"and with this the maiden would come to the king\" (Esther 2:13). And he said, \"Elohim has given me,\" for HaShem performed miracles for me until the king gave me the woman and I had these sons from her."], :book :genesis, :voice :ramban, :lang :en, :chapter 48, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T03:46:39.526614566Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}